cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Coupled CARLA in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Coupled CARLA: a human-factors driving simulator for real places"
abstract: >-
  Builds drivable CARLA worlds of real places from open data (OpenStreetMap, building registers, terrain, weather),
  fills them with SUMO traffic and puts several human participants (drivers, pedestrians, cyclists, AV passengers,
  drone pilots) and AI agents in the same world, logging every trial. Successor of coupled-sim.
type: software
authors:
